The [[Online (open beta)|online beta]] received a patch on December 14th, 2023, announced on [https://twitter.com/tyronerodriguez/status/1735436443072524677 Twitter].

== Documented Changes ==
* Raised the amount of health players get when getting revived
* Fixed more crashes on startup due to mods being installed
* Fixed softlock in online play when a player gets the controller disconnected popup
* Fix for active item on boss pedestal
* Players drop quest items when disconnecting
* Fixed occasional crash when pressing function keys on keyboard

